---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — Car PDI Checklist" description="Terms and Conditions for using the Car PDI Checklist app.">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);">
    <h1 class="display-lg" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="body-md" style="color: var(--color-muted); max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto;">Read our rules and guidelines.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-md);">
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;"><strong>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</strong></p>
    
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">By accessing and using the <strong>Car PDI Checklist</strong> application, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.</p>

    <h2 class="title-md">1. Informational Purpose Only</h2>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">This web application provides a general Pre-Delivery Inspection (PDI) checklist for educational and informational purposes. While we strive to make the checklist as comprehensive as possible for both ICE and EV vehicles, it may not cover every specific nuance or component of every car model.</p>

    <h2 class="title-md">2. No Liability</h2>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">The Car PDI Checklist is provided strictly on an "as is" basis. <strong>We are not liable for any defects, damages, or issues that you may miss during your inspection</strong>, nor are we liable for any disputes, financial losses, or legal conflicts that may arise between you and the dealership or manufacturer.</p>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">The final responsibility of accepting a vehicle lies entirely with the buyer. If you are unsure about the condition of a vehicle, we highly recommend hiring a certified third-party mechanic.</p>

    <h2 class="title-md">3. Fair Use</h2>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">This tool is completely free for individual car buyers. Dealerships and commercial vehicle inspectors are prohibited from copying, scraping, or white-labeling this tool's content and structure for commercial gain without explicit written permission from us.</p>

    <h2 class="title-md">4. Content Accuracy</h2>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">Guides on VIN decoding and inspection techniques are based on publicly available knowledge in the Indian automotive sector. Manufacturers may change their VIN formatting or vehicle specifications at any time, and we do not guarantee the absolute accuracy of these resources.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
